{"seq":2,"slug":"implementation-practice","title":"实施实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/belt-and-road-initiative/implementation-practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"infrastructure-projects","title":"基础设施项目：从走廊骨架到项目账本","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/belt-and-road-initiative/implementation-practice/infrastructure-projects","wordCount":2284,"readingTime":10},{"seq":2,"slug":"trade-facilitation","title":"贸易便利化：把时间从成本表里减掉","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/belt-and-road-initiative/implementation-practice/trade-facilitation","wordCount":2304,"readingTime":10},{"seq":3,"slug":"financial-cooperation","title":"金融合作：三层资金架构与债务方程","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/xi-jinping-thought/belt-and-road-initiative/implementation-practice/financial-cooperation","wordCount":2200,"readingTime":9}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"实施实践-简介\">实施实践 简介</h1><p>本章回答&quot;倡议是怎么落地的&quot;。愿景与行动发布（2015 年 3 月 28 日）之后，倡议进入项目、贸易与资金三条实线的推进期，本章三篇各管一本账：项目账、贸易账、资金账。三本账彼此咬合——基建项目创造贸易通道，贸易流量反过来检验项目的经济性，而两者的资金来源与偿付安排又构成金融篇的核心议题。</p>\n<p><strong>基础设施项目</strong>（<a href=\"infrastructure-projects\">1_infrastructure-projects.md</a>）以&quot;六廊六路&quot;为骨架，拆解三个铁路样本（中老、雅万、蒙内）各自不同的账本结构：中老铁路 2021 年 12 月 3 日通车、雅万高铁 2023 年 10 月 2 日商业运营但造价从约 60 亿美元超支至约 73 亿、蒙内铁路 2017 年 5 月 31 日通车后运量争议未断。篇末给出全生命周期净现值视角，作为判别&quot;白象工程&quot;的工具。</p>\n<p><strong>贸易便利化</strong>（<a href=\"trade-facilitation\">2_trade-facilitation.md</a>）把&quot;贸易畅通&quot;翻译成可度量的时间与成本：Hummels 与 Schaur（2013 年发表于《美国经济评论》）估计货物在途每多一天相当于 0.6%–2.1% 的从价关税，这解释了为什么通关改革、RCEP 原产地累积规则和丝路电商是贸易便利化的三个真实抓手。篇末讨论归因难题——贸易增长不等于倡议效果。</p>\n<p><strong>金融合作</strong>（<a href=\"financial-cooperation\">3_financial-cooperation.md</a>）拆解三层资金架构：多边的亚投行（2016 年 1 月 16 日开业，三大国际评级机构均给 AAA）、股权为主的丝路基金（2014 年 12 月 29 日注册，首单为巴基斯坦卡洛特水电站）、以及承担主力贷款的两家政策性银行。篇末给出债务动态方程 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfrac><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>p</mi><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{t+1}=\\frac{1+i}{1+g}d_t+pd_{t+1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9028em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3368em;vertical-align:-0.4811em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8557em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4811em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9028em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，作为第三章讨论债务争议时的判别框架。</p>\n<p>学习建议：三篇按&quot;项目 → 贸易 → 金融&quot;顺序读，每篇末尾的分析工具（净现值、关税等值、债务方程）会在第三章的争议评估中反复使用。</p>\n"}